{{ModBox}}
<section begin=intro />
'''Neutron Star''' is a [[Warframe Augment Mod]] for {{WF|Nova}}'s {{A|Null Star}} that allows it to inflict {{D|Heat}} damage with guaranteed status effect in a radius and recasting the ability will disperse currently active particles to seek out enemies before being replenished. Neutron Star's seek radius is doubled than that of Null Star's.
<section end=intro />

