==Acquisition==
*This mod can be acquired by attaining the rank of '''General''' under {{Faction|Steel Meridian}}, or the rank of '''Genius''' under {{Faction|Cephalon Suda}}, and spending {{sc|25,000}} to purchase.

==Notes==
*Explosion damage is affected by [[Ability Strength]].
*Explosion radius is affected by [[Ability Range]].
*Seek radius after 5 meters and explosion require line of sight.

==Tips==
*The augment deals a separated instance of {{D|Heat}} damage and status from Null Star, highly benefiting from the same modifiers that can affect {{A|Null Star}}, such as {{Arcane|Arcane Arachne}}, {{M|Holster Amp}}, {{M|Vigorous Swap}}, among others.
*The guaranteed proc chance makes the augment useful for short-range crowd control.
*The augment allows the user to refresh the innate damage reduction that each Null Star innately possess.


==Bugs==
* The augment description states that particles deal {{D|Heat}} damage with a guaranteed status effect in an 8m radius. However, in practice, enemies within the AoE also appear to receive {{D|Blast}} status effects. Because {{D|Blast}} effects can create additional AoE damage instances, this can result in compounding interactions when multiple enemies are hit simultaneously, effectively quadratic scaling when multiple enemies are clustered.
It’s unclear whether this is intended behavior (and the description is incomplete), or if Blast is being applied unintentionally in the AoE. Clarification would be appreciated.

